    "updated_at": "2025-07-16T07:28:49Z",
    "body": "Yeah, this seems like the right time to combine these algorithms so we only do a single tree walk. That's an observable change in behavior due to the events, but I think it's very much an acceptable one. And if we ever add more cases we care about we don't end up with ever more ancestor walks.",
